#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:1
msgid "CLI and Extensions"
msgstr "CLI 与扩展"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:3
msgid "RELIC exposes Command-Line Interface (CLI) modules, a FastAPI Representational State Transfer (REST) and WebSocket server for inspection and bounded operations, and a manifest-driven extension protocol for external Functors. Command availability does not replace the Python lifecycle or Graph Intermediate Representation (`GraphIR`) structural validation."
msgstr "RELIC 提供命令行接口（Command-Line Interface, CLI）模块、面向状态检视与有界操作的 FastAPI 表述性状态转移（Representational State Transfer, REST）及 WebSocket 服务端，以及面向外部 Functor 的清单驱动扩展协议。命令入口的可用性不替代 Python 生命周期管理或图中间表示（Graph Intermediate Representation, `GraphIR`）的结构校验。"

