#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:79
msgid "`path\\to\\graph.yaml` stands for a GraphIR file that you write; the repository ships no example GraphIR file. A `.yaml` or `.yml` file is read as YAML and any other suffix as JSON. The payload must be a mapping with a non-empty `schema_version` and a `nodes` mapping in which every node names a `class_type`; see [Graph Validation and Execution](graph_validation_and_execution.md)."
msgstr "`path\\to\\graph.yaml` 表示用户编写的 GraphIR 文件，仓库未提供示例 GraphIR 文件。`.yaml` 或 `.yml` 文件按 YAML 读取，其他后缀按 JSON 读取。载荷必须为映射，含非空 `schema_version` 和 `nodes` 映射，其中每个节点指定 `class_type`；参见[图验证与执行](graph_validation_and_execution.md)。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:85
msgid "Both forms include the topology audit; only the dedicated form provides `--no-topology-audit`. Both paths load the GraphIR and use the canonical registry, validation, and compile functions. `--auto-adapt` (compile only) lowers each required context-free `unit_cast` into an executable adapter node and validates the graph again; any other required adapter type is rejected (`unsupported_auto_adapter`). The adapter rules are described in [Graph Validation and Execution](graph_validation_and_execution.md)."
msgstr "两种形式都包含拓扑审计，仅专用形式提供 `--no-topology-audit`。两条路径都加载 GraphIR 并调用规范的注册、验证和编译函数。`--auto-adapt`（仅编译）将每个必需且无需上下文的 `unit_cast` 转换为可执行适配器节点，再次验证图；其他必需适配器类型会被拒绝（`unsupported_auto_adapter`）。适配器规则见[图验证与执行](graph_validation_and_execution.md)。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:93
msgid "Layered runner boundary"
msgstr "层次型跑者边界"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:99
msgid "The layered runner provides an explicit state-oriented runtime shell. It does not map every `RELICConfig` field to runtime keys and does not discover and register a complete scientific model. Use the Python workflow or a validated GraphIR when scientific Functor composition is required."
msgstr "分层运行器提供面向状态的显式运行时外壳；该入口不会将全部 `RELICConfig` 字段映射为运行时键，也不执行完整科学模型的发现与注册。需要组合科学计算 Functor 时，请使用 Python 工作流或经校验的图中间表示（GraphIR）。"

