#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:310
msgid "Stochastic CLI boundary"
msgstr "随机过程 CLI 边界"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:312
msgid "`stochastic sde` executes a bound continuous-SDE process through the canonical GraphIR/Functor path (strict compile, `GraphExecutor`, StateManager commit). The seed is mandatory because the Functor owns its Wiener substream, and the drift/diffusion coefficients come from the ParameterManager database, so the command accepts no per-run parameter overrides:"
msgstr "`stochastic sde` 通过 canonical GraphIR/Functor 路径（strict compile、`GraphExecutor`、StateManager commit）执行一个已绑定的连续 SDE 过程。Seed 是必需的，因为 Functor 拥有其 Wiener 子流，而 drift/diffusion 系数来自 ParameterManager 数据库，因此该命令不接受逐次运行的参数 override："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:322
msgid "`stochastic gillespie` executes a bound marked-jump process the same way (direct-SSA event clock plus the Functor's mark law, counts and marks starting from zero); arbitrary reaction-network declarations are rejected:"
msgstr "`stochastic gillespie` 以同样方式执行一个已绑定的标记跳跃过程（direct-SSA 事件时钟加上 Functor 的 mark 律，计数与 mark 从零开始）；任意的反应网络声明会被拒绝："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:330
msgid "The NetCDF output of both commands carries `trajectory_<state>` on `(sample, time)` for every bound state, the elapsed clock `time_seconds` on `time`, ensemble and exact analytic moments, and the compile assertion audit. `stochastic weather` remains `[N]` until its forcing operator has the same kind of validated runtime binding."
msgstr "两个命令的 NetCDF 输出都包含每个已绑定状态在 `(sample, time)` 上的 `trajectory_<state>`、在 `time` 上的经过时钟 `time_seconds`、ensemble 矩与精确解析矩，以及 compile assertion 审计。`stochastic weather` 在其 forcing operator 获得同类经过验证的 runtime 绑定之前仍为 `[N]`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:336
msgid "Optimization CLI boundary"
msgstr "优化CLI边界"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:338
msgid "The optimization subcommands (`calibrate`, `assimilate`, `sensitivity`, and `uncertainty`) are visible in the unified CLI and marked `[N]` `runtime_unbound`; they fail closed before running an optimizer or mutating parameters because no sealed `GraphIR`/`ExecutionPlan`/`GraphExecutor` runtime is bound. Use [Calibration, Sensitivity Analysis, and Uncertainty Quantification](calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md) for supported Python component operation."
msgstr "优化类子命令（`calibrate`、`assimilate`、`sensitivity` 与 `uncertainty`）在统一 CLI 中可见并标注为 `[N]` `runtime_unbound`；由于尚未绑定已封存的 `GraphIR`/`ExecutionPlan`/`GraphExecutor` 运行时，这些命令在启动优化器或修改参数前即执行封闭拒绝。受支持的 Python 组件调用方式参见[校准、敏感性分析和不确定性量化](calibration_sensitivity_and_uq.md)。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:346
msgid "FastAPI REST and WebSocket server"
msgstr "FastAPI REST 与 WebSocket 服务端"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:348
msgid "`relic\\interfaces\\api\\server.py` exposes `create_app()` and `run_server()` for HTTP and WebSocket inspection and orchestration. `create_app(enable_docs=False)` registers 38 application routes (37 HTTP endpoints plus 1 WebSocket endpoint `/graph/ws`); `create_app(enable_docs=True)` (the default) adds 4 OpenAPI and interactive documentation routes (`/openapi.json`, `/docs`, `/docs/oauth2-redirect`, and `/redoc`) for 42 total entries on `app.routes`:"
msgstr "`relic\\interfaces\\api\\server.py` 提供 `create_app()` 与 `run_server()`，用于启动 HTTP 与 WebSocket 检视及编排服务。`create_app(enable_docs=False)` 注册 38 条应用路由（37 个 HTTP 端点加 1 个 WebSocket 端点 `/graph/ws`）；默认的 `create_app(enable_docs=True)` 额外注册 4 条 OpenAPI 与交互式文档路由（`/openapi.json`、`/docs`、`/docs/oauth2-redirect` 与 `/redoc`），在 `app.routes` 上合计注册 42 个路由条目："

