#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/cli_and_extensions.md:367
msgid "All non-health application routers (`/graph/*`, `/data/*`, `/compute/*`, `/optimization/*`, `/stochastic/*`, and `/config/*`) enforce API key authentication (`X-API-Key` header or `Authorization: Bearer <token>`, configured through `RELIC_API_KEY`, `RELIC_API_KEYS`, or `security.api_auth.api_keys`), while rate limiting is governed by the parameters `interfaces.api.rate_limit.enabled` and `interfaces.api.rate_limit.requests_per_minute`."
msgstr "除健康检查外的全部应用路由分组（`/graph/*`、`/data/*`、`/compute/*`、`/optimization/*`、`/stochastic/*` 与 `/config/*`）均强制执行 API 密钥鉴权（支持 `X-API-Key` 请求头或 `Authorization: Bearer <token>`，通过 `RELIC_API_KEY`、`RELIC_API_KEYS` 或 `security.api_auth.api_keys` 配置）；请求速率限制由参数 `interfaces.api.rate_limit.enabled` 与 `interfaces.api.rate_limit.requests_per_minute` 统一管控。"

